## Browse anchor history

```
GET /v1/on-chain/history
```

A paginated list of Merkle-root anchoring events (not score publications -- there is no publication history endpoint).

**Query parameters:** `chain` (`base` or `base-sepolia`), `agent_id` (filter to anchors that included this agent), `from` / `to` (ISO 8601 date-time range), `limit` (1-100, default 50), `offset`.

<CodeGroup>
```bash cURL
curl "https://api.mnemom.ai/v1/on-chain/history?chain=base&limit=10"
```

```typescript TypeScript
const history = await fetch(
  'https://api.mnemom.ai/v1/on-chain/history?limit=10',
).then((r) => r.json());

for (const anchor of history.anchors) {
  console.log(`block ${anchor.block_number}: ${anchor.merkle_root}`);
}
```
</CodeGroup>

**Response:**

```json
{
  "anchors": [
    {
      "tx_hash": "0x1234...",
      "block_number": 18234567,
      "chain": "base",
      "anchored_at": "2026-02-26T10:30:00.000Z"
    }
  ],
  "limit": 10,
  "offset": 0
}
```

